51
00:03:18,820 --> 00:03:25,780
Speaker 1: All right, but just because God had foreknowledge of it does not mean God predetermined or predestined it.

52
00:03:26,580 --> 00:03:29,300
Speaker 1: And that is very important, a distinction.

53
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:33,950
Speaker 1: Just for clarification, there are things that God has predetermined.

54
